    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Belenus</i> is an open-world adventure RPG set on a desolate Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 14,602 CE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this Earth, long abandoned by most of humanity,<br>what happened in the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit various locations and search for clues to piece together lost memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3D open-world, control your character to collect items, solve puzzles in the environment, and follow a story interwoven with cinematic cutscenes. Along the way, you'll encounter numerous side quests and opportunities to explore off the beaten path.</p>",
